# Record with: `vhs docs/demo.tape` (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs)
# Produces docs/demo.gif for the README when vhs + ttyrec deps are installed.

Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1050
Set Height 620
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 75ms

Type "uv run klima Berlin --refresh-minutes 60" Sleep 1s Enter Sleep 12s Type "q" Sleep 600ms Enter
